{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17204060","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17204060","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1720406001:1":{"text":"一群废物！连只猴子跟鹦鹉都抓不住！那可是我从马戏团高价收购的、准备献给王子殿下的礼物！","source_cn":"一群废物！连只猴子跟鹦鹉都抓不住！那可是我从马戏团高价...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA5886C6535303BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720406002:1":{"text":"男爵大人，那只鹦鹉飞得太高了，那只猴子动作也很灵活……","source_cn":"男爵大人，那只鹦鹉飞得太高了，那只猴子动作也很灵活……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x998190C1E3A461B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720406003:1":{"text":"别跟我废话那么多！听着！必须把它们毫发无伤地给我抓回来！","source_cn":"别跟我废话那么多！听着！必须把它们毫发无伤地给我抓回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2E948ADF59B41AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720406004:1":{"text":"抓到了，重重有赏！要是让它们跑了，你们就等着掉脑袋吧！","source_cn":"抓到了，重重有赏！要是让它们跑了，你们就等着掉脑袋吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA111AD456B73B8C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720406005:1":{"text":"男爵气冲冲地离开了，留下束手无策的守备军、被抢的摊主和看热闹的市民们面面相觑。","source_cn":"男爵气冲冲地离开了，留下束手无策的守备军、被抢的摊主和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11C86B5695A997A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1720406005":{"text":"男爵气冲冲地离开了，留下束手无策的守备军、被抢的摊主和看热闹的市民们面面相觑。","source_cn":"男爵气冲冲地离开了，留下束手无策的守备军、被抢的摊主和看热闹的市民们面面相觑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11C86B5695A997A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720406006:0":{"text":"刚刚那人是谁啊？口气那么大！","source_cn":"刚刚那人是谁啊？口气那么大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B0D5E7EEDE0BA59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720406007:0":{"text":"那位是葛朗台男爵……","source_cn":"那位是葛朗台男爵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12860A5E56B419D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720406008:0":{"text":"听都没听说过，估计又是哪个从乡下来的暴发户吧。","source_cn":"听都没听说过，估计又是哪个从乡下来的暴发户吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8746E7D0B7E1A860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1720406009:1":{"text":"赛凡纳的贵族遍地都是，天上掉下块石头，都能砸到不止一个子爵呢，他在这里逞什么威风！","source_cn":"赛凡纳的贵族遍地都是，天上掉下块石头，都能砸到不止一个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA966258F8F34E495","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1720406010:1":{"text":"哼，那胖贵族自己就是个猴样！就算给我一万金币，我也不伺候他！","source_cn":"哼，那胖贵族自己就是个猴样！就算给我一万金币，我也不伺候他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA05A3694B7D4DB6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1720406011:0":{"text":"他要献给王子猴子和鹦鹉？我看这事不简单。","source_cn":"他要献给王子猴子和鹦鹉？我看这事不简单。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x556FE14AE971E710","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1720406012:1":{"text":"这猴子这么凶猛，鹦鹉这么聒噪，是不是王后那边派来的，想用这些不通礼数的畜生伤害王子殿下？","source_cn":"这猴子这么凶猛，鹦鹉这么聒噪，是不是王后那边派来的，想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E58264625F2F548","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1720406013:1":{"text":"胡说！王子殿下英明神武，岂会怕这两个家伙？","source_cn":"胡说！王子殿下英明神武，岂会怕这两个家伙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42961939A00F065B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1720406014:1":{"text":"毕竟王子不是王后亲生的，不得不防啊……","source_cn":"毕竟王子不是王后亲生的，不得不防啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x899B8D6190D3209C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1720406015:1":{"text":"我听说国王陛下病重，那位后妈现在可得意了！","source_cn":"我听说国王陛下病重，那位后妈现在可得意了！","status":"ma